  "description": "Dremel EZ406-02 1 1/2-Inch EZ Lock Rotary Tool Cut-Off... - Distributed/Packaged by Dremel. Product Details: Dremel EZ406-02 1 1/2-Inch EZ Lock Rotary Tool Cut-Off... - Distributed/Packaged by Dremel. Product Details: Dremel EZ406-02 1 1/2-Inch EZ Lock Rotary Tool Cut-Off Wheel and Mandrel Metal Cutting Starter Kit - Distributed/Packaged by Dremel. Product Details: Turn your Dremel rotary tool into a powerful cutting machine with the EZ Lock™ Starter Kit. The EZ406-02 includes the EZ402 mandrel and 5 EZ456 Fiberglass Reinforced Cut-Off wheels. The cut-off wheels are designed to last 2X longer compared to the 426. The highly-durable cut-off wheels feature a 1-1/2 In. (38.1 mm) wheel diameter and 0.045 In. (1.1mm) thick blade making it ideal to cut, groove, and trim all types of metal including hardened steel. Perfect for projects like cutting bolt heads, reslotting damaged screws, cutting sheet metal, or trimming metal rods. The cutting discs are also ideal for delicate woodworking projects and can be used on other materials including wood, plastics or ceramics. The wheels are designed with the patented EZ Lock™ system making accessory changes quick and easy.",
